SCOPE OF THIS LICENCE

This MIT licence covers only the original AutoSplat source code in this
repository: the Swift application, the Xcode project files and the help pages.

It does NOT cover:

1. The SHARP model. AutoSplat does not include the model. It downloads a Core ML
   conversion of Apple's SHARP model at runtime, and that model stays under the
   Apple Machine Learning Research Model License Agreement, which allows research
   use only. See licenses/APPLE_ML_RESEARCH_MODEL_LICENSE.txt.

2. Third-party files listed in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. They keep their own
   licences.
